  "id": "terminal-care",
  "term": "terminal care",
  "definition": "Terminal care is care provided to people who are terminally ill or dying, especially in the final stage of illness. In this context, it involves efforts such as reducing non-beneficial interventions, addressing poor prognosis openly, offering palliative care, and providing compassionate care.",
